              <span class="text-white font-semibold text-sm mt-1 block">Sat 12 Sep 2026, 4:00–5:00 PM EDT</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950/50 border border-slate-800 text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-start gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot text-red-400 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <span><strong>Onsite:</strong> Transamerica Milpitas office : 1629 S Main Street, Milpitas 95035</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="p-3 rounded-xl bg-blue-950/40 border border-blue-800/60 text-xs text-slate-300 flex items-start gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-video text-blue-400 mt-0.5"></i>
            <div>
              <span><strong>Zoom Online:</strong> <a href="https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-semibold">https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1</a> (Meeting ID: <code class="text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono">912 0290 6018</code>, Passcode: <code class="text-white px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 font-mono">18970521</code>)</span>
