            <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
            <span>VI AI Music Academy</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          Free Community Event. Onsite + Zoom. 60 min.
        </p>

        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 space-y-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">Zero-to-one hands-on demo: create a complete song on the spot.</p>
          <p class="text-sm">No music theory lectures, no contest rule briefings.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-list-check text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Workshop Agenda</span>
          </h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-300 pl-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:00–1:08</span>
              <span>What makes a complete song</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:08–1:20</span>
              <span>Generate draft v1 live on the spot</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:20–1:35</span>
              <span>Refine Chinese lyrics</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:35–1:50</span>
              <span>Adjust style tags and negative prompts</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="font-mono text-blue-400 font-semibold">1:50–2:00</span>
              <span>Save prompts and audio assets</span>
            </li>
