            <li>• Luma Registration: <a href="https://luma.com/wow7m019" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://luma.com/wow7m019</a></li>
            <li>• Join Zoom Meeting: <a href="https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://zoom.us/j/91202906018?pwd=5QIaOX06xJLYb3bYta2s3dW7RTAKum.1</a> (Meeting ID: 912 0290 6018, Passcode: 18970521)</li>
            <li>• Academy Website: <a href="https://music.weiai.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">https://music.weiai.ai</a></li>
