        </div>

        <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 italic">
          Free Community Event. No payments, transfers, or verification codes required.
        </p>

        <div class="border-t border-slate-900 pt-6 mt-8 space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <h4 class="font-semibold text-slate-300">Organizers</h4>
          <p><strong>Organizers:</strong> ZJUAA NC, VI AI Foundation, VI AI for Good Foundation</p>
          <p><strong>Executive Organizer:</strong> VI AI Foundation, VI AI for Good Foundation</p>
          <p><strong>Co-organizers:</strong> NACUAA AI Venture & Impact Club, NACUAA NC Chapter, SC Chapter, Washington DC Chapter, Northern California Chapter, ZJUAA Tennessee, ZJUAA Philadelphia, ZJUAA Rhode Island, ZJUAA Florida</p>
          <p><strong>Media Support:</strong> North Alpha Post</p>
        </div>
